 "blurb": "Characters shuffle in from a direction (up/down/left/right) when scrolled into…",
 "description": "Uses GSAP SplitText to split into characters and animate each shuffling in from a specified direction. Triggered on scroll visibility or on hover. Supports looping, color transitions, and respects prefers-reduced-motion.",
 "use_when": "A heading wants a dynamic shuffle reveal that's tied to scroll progress or hover interaction.",
 "avoid_when": "When instant readability is required; the shuffle animation takes time to complete.",
 "a11y": "Text is split into character elements and animated. Readability is maintained after animation completes. Respects prefers-reduced-motion.",
